% THE NUMBERING DIFFERS FROM THE PREPRINT, which is what this paper had been citing until
% 2026-10-09.  The journal version is much shorter (13 pp. against the preprint's 26) and was
% reorganised: the f-vector material is Section 3, not Section 5.  The map is
%     preprint  Section 5        -> published  Section 3
%     preprint  Theorem 5.1      -> published  Theorem 3.1   (Clements-Lindstrom)
%     preprint  Theorem 5.2      -> published  Theorem 3.2   (the two recursions, (6) and (7))
%     preprint  Theorem 5.3      -> published  Theorem 3.3   (polynomiality in p)
%     preprint  Proposition 5.4  -> published  Proposition 2.8 (the leading coefficient; 3.3 is
%                                  what carries it over from M^p(n) to F^p(n) and E^p(n,k))
% The boundary values F^p(-1)=1, F^p(0)=2, F^0(n)=2, E^p(n,-1)=1, E^p(n,n)=1, E^p(n,k)=0 for k>n
% and the identity F^p(n)=sum_k E^p(n,k) (published equation (5)) are all in Section 3's prose.
% AND THE APPENDIX IS GONE: the published version has no appendix and prints exactly one table,
% its own Table 1, of M^p(n).  Tables 5 and 6 -- the ones this paper checks itself against --
% exist only in the preprint, which is why Linusson1999preprint below is a separate entry.
